        {self.ANTI_GASLIGHTING_PROMPT}

        Generate STUNNING, FLUID animation logic for: {file_path}
        Expertises: Framer Motion (variants, layoutid), Three.js (R3F), GSAP, Spring physics, CSS Keyframes.
        
